hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1474","Ali bin Hajar Al-Saadi brought us strange news, Ali bin Mushar, on the authority of Al-A’mash, on the authority of Abu Salih, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, and Abu Sa’id, on the authority of The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, in his saying that the dawn recitation will be witnessed, Surah Al-Isra, verse 78, he said: “The angels of the night and the angels of the day bear witness together.” “In it.” Abu Bakr said: I dictated in the beginning of the Book of Prayer, the mention of the meeting of the angels of the night and the angels of the day in the dawn and afternoon prayers."
